{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "P013",
  "request": "« Prépare le runtime nécessaire, puis annule l’opération si je change d’avis. »",
  "requires": [
    "isolated-vm",
    "motion-runtime-absent",
    "runtime-install-authorized"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "project",
      "action": "project.create",
      "input": {
        "name": "Bench Project",
        "folder": {
          "$ref": "sandbox"
        }
      },
      "saveAs": "project",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "actual": {
            "$ref": "project.path"
          },
          "op": "equal",
          "expected": {
            "$ref": "projectPath"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "before",
      "action": "ai.localState",
      "input": {},
      "saveAs": "before",
      "assertions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "install",
      "action": "ai.manageLocalRuntime",
      "input": {
        "operation": "installRuntime",
        "profile": "motion"
      },
      "saveAs": "install",
      "assertions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel",
      "action": "ai.manageLocalRuntime",
      "input": {
        "operation": "cancelRuntimeInstall",
        "profile": "motion"
      },
      "saveAs": "cancel",
      "assertions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "after",
      "action": "ai.localState",
      "input": {},
      "saveAs": "after",
      "assertions": []
    }
  ],
  "blockers": [
    "Installation peut être synchrone ou déjà terminée ; le modèle de déclaration actuel ne lance pas deux actions concurrentes. Définir témoin de tâche réel et oracle état du moteur avant de prétendre tester une annulation en cours."
  ],
  "trainingApproved": false
}
